===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*sem-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|resemblen}}, from {{der|en|xno|resembler}}, {{m|fro|ressembler}}, from {{m|fro|re-}} + {{m|fro|sembler|t=to seem}}. {{surf|en|re-|semble}}.

